---
import ProseLayout from '@/layouts/ProseLayout.astro';
import Callout from '@/components/Callout.astro';
import { url } from '@/lib/url';
---

<ProseLayout title="Privacy Policy" lead="Short version: we do not track you." lastUpdated="2026-10-11">
  <Callout kind="verify" title="Draft for review">
    <p>
      This policy describes how the site is built. The site owner must review it (ideally with legal advice) before the
      site goes public, especially the hosting section.
    </p>
  </Callout>

  <h2>What we do not do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>No analytics or statistics tools.</li>
    <li>No cookies.</li>
    <li>No advertising, no affiliate links, no social media buttons or tracking pixels.</li>
    <li>No accounts or sign-ups. We do not ask for your name or email address.</li>
    <li>Fonts are served from this website itself, not from a third-party font service.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What is stored in your own browser</h2>
  <p>
    To remember your settings and learning progress, the site uses your browser's <em>local storage</em>. This data stays
    on your device; it is never sent to us or anyone else. All keys start with <code>stockora-</code>. Currently stored:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><code>stockora-theme</code>: whether you chose light or dark mode.</li>
    <li><code>stockora-progress</code>: which lessons you marked as done, and when.</li>
    <li><code>stockora-bookmarks</code>: lessons you bookmarked.</li>
    <li><code>stockora-quiz-scores</code>: your best and latest score for each quiz.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    This list will be kept up to date. You can delete all of it at any time by clearing this site's data in your browser settings.
  </p>

  <h2>Videos (YouTube)</h2>
  <p>
    Lesson and topic pages include educational YouTube videos. A video does <strong>not</strong> load until you click on
    it, and before that no data (not even a preview image) is requested from YouTube.
    Only then does your browser connect to YouTube (using the privacy-enhanced <code>youtube-nocookie.com</code> domain),
    and YouTube's own privacy policy applies. Every video also has a plain "Watch on YouTube" link instead.
  </p>

  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>
    This website is hosted on GitHub Pages, a service of GitHub, Inc. Like any web server, the hosting provider receives
    technical data needed to deliver pages (for example your IP address and browser information) and may log it, for
    example for security purposes. We do not have access to visitor logs.
  </p>
  <Callout kind="verify">
    <p>
      The site owner must check GitHub's current terms and privacy statement for GitHub Pages, and add the required
      details here (provider, purpose, legal basis, data transfers).
    </p>
  </Callout>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy questions, use the contact details in the <a href={url('/impressum')}>Impressum</a>.</p>
</ProseLayout>
